  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-15T11:53:58.226Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nThe indicator (Menu Laser) for when you are hovering above the mirror and *should* be able to grab it, also shows when something is in the way and you aren't actually able to grab it. This makes it really confusing and also annoying to use Immersive Mode, since you never know if you are actually able to grab the mirror now or not.\nWhen a player is in the way for example you still see the indicator for being able to grab it even though in that case you can't actually grab it.\n# Suggestion:\nOnly show the indicator when you are actually able to grab the mirror and not just when your hand is pointing at it.\n# Attachments:\nIn this video I'm spam clicking my left mouse button and you can see that the indicator is still there when I'm above the player, but I can't actually grab the mirror in that case.\nhttps://streamable.com/kw4yun",
